<title>FRANCE: Block of Valeo stock traded.</title>
<headline>Block of Valeo stock traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 210,500 shares in French car parts maker Valeo changed hands in midmorning, at 309 francs per share, market sources said.</p>
<p>Two other block trades totalling 355,000 shares went through on November 18 at 310.90 francs per share. The sources said there was talk of the sale of a two percent holding by Union des Assureurs de Paris (UAP).</p>
<p>Valeo was up 0.13 percent at 311 francs at 1027 GMT, while the market was up 0.63 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 nr/pnt/cla</p>
